# WHAT YOU RETURN

One JSON object: {"objects": [ ... ]}, one entry per object listed above, same name,
same order.

    {
      "name": "grey storage bin",
      "title": "Storage bin",
      "body": "Open grey bin holding a yellow dry bag, a blue tool and loose hand tools.",
      "steps": [],
      "tags": ["storage", "tools", "floor"]
