# FIELDS

name        Exactly the name listed above, unchanged. It is what ties this entry to a box.
title       Max 5 words. This is what the label reads.
body        Max 14 words, one sentence. What it is and what state it is in. Only what you
            can actually see. Never guess a brand, a number or a capacity.
steps       Only when there is a real action to take with it, max 2. Otherwise [].
tags        2-5 lowercase keywords.

# RULES

1. One entry per object listed above. Do not add objects and do not drop any.
2. Describe only what you can see in this frame. Never invent state you cannot observe.

Write it compactly: no indentation and no spaces that are not needed.

Output only the JSON object. No markdown, no commentary.
